**GW-BASIC Program (2019 Exam):**
```basic
10 CLS
20 SUM = 0
30 INPUT "Enter number of items purchased: "; N
40 FOR A = 1 TO N
50 INPUT "Enter price of item: "; P
60 SUM = SUM + P
70 NEXT A
80 TAX = SUM * 0.13
90 TB = SUM + TAX
100 PRINT "The Total Bill is: "; TB
110 IF TB >= 1 AND TB <= 10000 THEN SC = 250 ELSE SC = 500
120 PRINT "The Service Charges are: "; SC
130 END
```

**2025 Syllabus Equivalent (JavaScript):**
```javascript
let n = parseInt(prompt("Enter total number of items purchased:"));
let totalPrice = 0;
for (let i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
    let price = parseFloat(prompt("Enter price of item " + i + ":"));
    totalPrice += price;
}
let tax = totalPrice * 0.13;
let totalBill = totalPrice + tax;
document.write("Total Bill: " + totalBill + "<br>");
let serviceCharges = (totalBill <= 10000) ? 250 : 500;
document.write("Service Charges: " + serviceCharges);
```

**GW-BASIC Program (2019 Exam):**
```basic
10 CLS
20 INPUT "Enter total kilometres travelled: "; D
30 IF D <= 5 THEN SUBCOST = D * 30 ELSE SUBCOST = (5 * 30) + ((D - 5) * 25)
40 BILL = SUBCOST + 50
50 PRINT "Total Cab Service Bill = "; BILL
60 END
```

**2025 Syllabus Equivalent (JavaScript):**
```javascript
let d = parseFloat(prompt("Enter number of kilometres travelled:"));
let subCost;
if (d <= 5) {
    subCost = d * 30;
} else {
    subCost = (5 * 30) + ((d - 5) * 25);
}
let totalBill = subCost + 50;
document.write("Total Cab Bill: Rs. " + totalBill);
```
